Package: fluxCore
Type: Package
Title: Simulation Modeling of Probabilistic Dynamic Systems Models in Irregular Time: Core Architecture
Version: 1.11.0
Author: Jarrod Dalton [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jarrod Dalton <daltonj@ccf.org>
Authors@R: person(given = "Jarrod",
                  family = "Dalton",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "daltonj@ccf.org")
Description: A scaffold for event-driven simulation projects in R. Provides a schema-based
    R6 entity object for mutable state with sparse history and an Engine for orchestrating
    simulations using pluggable ModelBundles loaded by ModelProviders (package, file,
    MLflow-friendly stubs). Supports non-uniform event times, event types, terminal events,
    and no-update events.
License: LGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
